        "titleScale": 1,
        "note": "The city above the tree canopy: the frame in the Malaysia body of work that reads as Kuala Lumpur and still holds a wide, quiet lower band for the title. Replaces photo-0036 (2048px phone file, below the fidelity floor) and photo-0122 (the Kapas cove), on the owner instruction that Malaysia should open on Kuala Lumpur. The chapter title stays \"Malaysia\": no photograph in this destination carries a confirmed city, so the frame may open the chapter but must not yet be captioned as Kuala Lumpur.",
        "grade": {
          "linear": [
            1.13,
            -13
          ],
          "saturation": 1.05
        },
        "gradeNote": "Haze correction. The frame is a long lens across humid city air, and the veil that flattens it is atmosphere between camera and subject, not the photograph. Lifting the black point and adding 5% colour restores the separation the lens lost. Tested against a local-contrast (CLAHE) variant and a stronger colour variant; both started showing an HDR signature in the cloud edges, so neither was used."
      }
